---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Coaching individuel - Sonny Court"
  description="Un accompagnement humain et personnalisé pour t'aider à dépasser tes blocages et avancer vers tes objectifs."
  noindex={true}
  hideFormationsInHeader={true}
  hideBlogInHeader={true}
  hideFormationsInFooter={true}
  headerVariant="glass"
  footerVariant="compact-glass"
>
  <div class="coach-page">
    <div class="page-background" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <section class="coach-hero" aria-labelledby="coach-page-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
        Coaching individuel
      </div>

      <h1 id="coach-page-title">
        L’accompagnement humain pour
        <span>transformer ta vie</span>
      </h1>

      <p>
        Avance avec un coach sélectionné par Sonny Court, une méthode claire
        et un accompagnement entièrement adapté à ta situation.
      </p>

      <a class="hero-cta" href="#romain">Découvrir ton coach</a>
    </section>

    <main class="coach-main">
      <section id="romain" class="coach-card" aria-labelledby="romain-name">
        <div class="coach-portrait">
          <img
            src="/media/coachs/romain.webp?v=ai-hd"
            alt="Portrait de Romain"
            width="640"
            height="640"
          />

          <div class="availability">
            <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
            Disponible
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="coach-profile">
          <div class="profile-topline">
            <span>Méthode SONICO</span>
            <span class="profile-separator" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>Coach partenaire</span>
          </div>

          <h2 id="romain-name">Romain</h2>
          <p class="coach-role">Coach en transformation et hypnothérapeute</p>

          <p class="coach-intro">
            Depuis près de 20 ans, Romain accompagne celles et ceux qui veulent
            comprendre ce qui les retient, dépasser leurs blocages intérieurs
            et remettre du mouvement là où tout semblait figé.
          </p>

          <div class="expertise-list" aria-label="Domaines d'accompagnement">
            <span>Concept de soi</span>
            <span>Confiance</span>
            <span>Passage à l’action</span>
            <span>Objectifs de vie</span>
          </div>

          <div class="session-offer">
            <div>
              <span class="session-label">Première séance découverte</span>
              <strong>47 €</strong>
            </div>
            <p>Un premier échange individuel pour clarifier ta situation et identifier la suite la plus adaptée.</p>
          </div>

          <a class="primary-cta" href="#reservation">
            Réserver ma séance découverte
          </a>

          <p class="cta-note">45 minutes · En visioconférence · Sans engagement</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="journey" aria-labelledby="journey-title">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <span>Une démarche simple</span>
          <h2 id="journey-title">Commence là où tu en es</h2>
          <p>Pas de formule imposée. Tu avances une séance après l’autre, à ton rythme.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="journey-grid">
          <article>
            <span class="step-number">01</span>
            <h3>Fais le point</h3>
            <p>Explique ta situation, tes objectifs et ce que tu n’arrives plus à dépasser seul.</p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span class="step-number">02</span>
            <h3>Vis une vraie séance</h3>
            <p>Romain t’aide à faire émerger le blocage central et une première direction concrète.</p>
          </article>

          <article>
            <span class="step-number">03</span>
            <h3>Choisis librement la suite</h3>
            <p>Continue à la séance, choisis un pack d’accompagnement ou arrête sans engagement.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="reservation" class="reservation-panel" aria-labelledby="reservation-title">
        <div>
          <span class="reservation-label">Bientôt disponible</span>
          <h2 id="reservation-title">Prêt à faire le premier pas ?</h2>
          <p>Les réservations avec Romain ouvriront prochainement.</p>
        </div>

        <button type="button" disabled aria-disabled="true">
          Réservations bientôt ouvertes
        </button>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .coach-page {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow: hidden;
    isolation: isolate;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: #02050c;
  }

  .page-background {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: -2;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 76% 18%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22), transparent 26%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 15% 54%, rgba(14, 116, 144, 0.09), transparent 32%),
      linear-gradient(118deg, #02050c 0%, #061226 45%, #092755 78%, #0b356f 100%);
  }

  .page-background::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        112deg,
        transparent 0%,
        transparent 32%,
        rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.08) 51%,
        rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.015) 63%,
        transparent 75%
      ),
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        90deg,
        transparent 0,
        transparent calc(12.5% - 1px),
        rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.035) 12.5%
      );
    mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 0%, transparent 92%);
    -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000 0%, transparent 92%);
  }

  .coach-hero {
    width: min(960px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 176px 0 92px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    width: fit-content;
    margin: 0 auto 24px;
    padding: 8px 13px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.14);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.7);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .eyebrow-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #60a5fa;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.9);
  }

  .coach-hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(52px, 7.5vw, 96px);
    font-weight: 780;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .coach-hero h1 span {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 8px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #dbeafe 42%, #7da8df 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .coach-hero > p {
    max-width: 690px;
    margin: 30px auto 0;
    color: rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.66);
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.6vw, 20px);
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .hero-cta,
  .primary-cta {
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.28);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: #ffffff;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #087cf4 0%, #1858d6 100%);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      0 16px 38px rgba(0, 75, 190, 0.3);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition:
      transform 0.25s ease,
      box-shadow 0.25s ease,
      border-color 0.25s ease;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    margin-top: 34px;
    padding: 16px 25px;
    display: inline-flex;
  }

  .hero-cta:hover,
  .primary-cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.5);
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.24),
      0 20px 48px rgba(0, 75, 190, 0.42);
  }

  .hero-cta:focus-visible,
  .primary-cta:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #93c5fd;
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .coach-main {
    width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 40px));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-bottom: 96px;
  }

  .coach-card {
    padding: 18px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(320px, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: 52px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.16);
    border-radius: 36px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.085), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.028));
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13),
      0 32px 100px rgba(0, 4, 18, 0.33);
    backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(150%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(150%);
  }

  .coach-portrait {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 620px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.12);
    border-radius: 26px;
    background: rgba(2, 6, 23, 0.4);
  }

  .coach-portrait::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(2, 6, 18, 0.64), transparent 40%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.08), transparent 42%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .coach-portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(0.45) contrast(1.02);
  }

  .availability {
    position: absolute;
    left: 18px;
    bottom: 18px;
    z-index: 1;
    padding: 9px 13px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
    background: rgba(4, 14, 29, 0.62);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .availability span {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #4ade80;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(74, 222, 128, 0.68);
  }

  .coach-profile {
    padding: 44px 42px 38px 0;
    align-self: center;
  }

  .profile-topline {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.72);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .profile-separator {
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.44);
  }

  .coach-profile h2 {
    margin: 17px 0 3px;
    font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 86px);
    font-weight: 780;
    line-height: 0.96;
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
  }

  .coach-role {
    margin: 0;
    color: rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.58);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 530;
  }

  .coach-intro {
    max-width: 570px;
    margin: 27px 0 0;
    color: rgba(239, 246, 255, 0.76);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .expertise-list {
    margin-top: 25px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .expertise-list span {
    padding: 8px 11px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.11);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.7);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.038);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 560;
  }

  .session-offer {
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.11);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.11);
  }

  .session-offer > div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .session-label {
    color: rgba(239, 246, 255, 0.86);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .session-offer strong {
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
  }

  .session-offer p {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    color: rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.5);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .primary-cta {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 24px;
    padding: 17px 22px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-note {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.42);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .journey {
    padding: 132px 0 116px;
  }

  .section-heading {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto 46px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-heading > span,
  .reservation-label {
    color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.82);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .section-heading h2,
  .reservation-panel h2 {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 5vw, 58px);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .section-heading p,
  .reservation-panel p {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.53);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .journey-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .journey-grid article {
    min-height: 250px;
    padding: 28px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.11);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.052), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.018));
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);
  }

  .step-number {
    color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.68);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 750;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .journey-grid h3 {
    margin: 68px 0 0;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .journey-grid p {
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    color: rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.52);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .reservation-panel {
    padding: 42px 46px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 36px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.15);
    border-radius: 30px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 88% 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18), transparent 42%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.076), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025));
    box-shadow:
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11),
      0 30px 80px rgba(0, 4, 18, 0.22);
    backdrop-filter: blur(26px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(26px);
  }

  .reservation-panel h2 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 4vw, 48px);
  }

  .reservation-panel button {
    min-width: 250px;
    padding: 16px 22px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.14);
    border-radius: 999px;
    color: rgba(219, 234, 254, 0.5);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
    font: inherit;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 650;
    cursor: not-allowed;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .coach-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }

    .coach-portrait {
      min-height: auto;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }

    .coach-profile {
      padding: 38px 24px 28px;
    }

    .journey-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .journey-grid article {
      min-height: 0;
    }

    .journey-grid h3 {
      margin-top: 38px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .coach-hero {
      width: min(100% - 28px, 960px);
      padding: 132px 0 66px;
    }

    .coach-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(37px, 10vw, 48px);
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
    }

    .coach-hero > p {
      margin-top: 23px;
      padding: 0 6px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 28px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .coach-main {
      width: min(100% - 24px, 1160px);
      padding-bottom: 66px;
    }

    .coach-card {
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 27px;
    }

    .coach-portrait {
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1.03;
      border-radius: 21px;
    }

    .coach-profile {
      padding: 31px 15px 24px;
    }

    .coach-profile h2 {
      font-size: 58px;
    }

    .coach-intro {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .session-offer > div {
      align-items: flex-end;
    }

    .session-label {
      max-width: 180px;
    }

    .journey {
      padding: 92px 0 82px;
    }

    .journey-grid article {
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .reservation-panel {
      padding: 31px 24px;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: stretch;
      border-radius: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .reservation-panel button {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .hero-cta,
    .primary-cta {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
